SUMMARY:A Night at Park Winters Presents Brandon & James
DESCRIPTION:Join Park Winters on June 25th from 6:30pm to 10:00pm for an experience like no other including a dinner buffet\, dessert bar and an unforgettable show from the acclaimed cello\, vocal\, and piano duo from America’s Got Talent. \nAmerica’s Got Talent finalists Branden & James are thrilled to make their debut at Park Winters with their new show – BRITISH INVASION. Direct from its debut in London\, UK\, get ready for the musical showdown with “dazzling cello and soaring tenor vocals” (NPR Music). Featuring songs by some of the best British artists of all time – Elton John\, Van Morrison\, QUEEN\, Adele\, David Bowie\, Mick Jagger\, The Beatles\, Ed Sheeran\, and many more icons from across The Pond. \nDinner buffet from 6:30 to 8:30 with the performance beginning at 8:30pm. \n$95 per person (non-refundable)\, including dinner and show
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/a-night-at-park-winters-presents-brandon-james/
LOCATION:Park Winters\, Park Winters\, 27850 County Road 26 Winters\, CA 95694
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/DJI_0496-10.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Park Winters":MAILTO:info@parkwinters.com
END:VEVENT
