SUMMARY:Twilight - Presented by Yolo County Wines
DESCRIPTION:Our association’s annual summer event. It’s all your favorite Yolo wineries\, all pouring at one location in the beautiful Capay Valley! \nThe most anticipated Northern California wine event of the year. A sell-out event with 10+ wineries pouring in 1 location! \n\nTickets include a wine-tasting session hosted by the 10+ participating wineries from 6:00 – 7:30. Afterwards\, stay and enjoy wine and beer by the glass\, food\, and live music performance as you dance the night away!\nFood Truck: Nash & Proper + Compa’s Pizza + Dessert Truck \nBand: AKAlive + Taylor Chicks
